  "type": "page",
  "content": "<div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></span></div><p>Pictures were also taken as The Beatles stood in a path between the cottages and the main house.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_56/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"135\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_56-135x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_56-135x200.jpg 135w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_56.jpg 382w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" data-attachment-id=\"9026\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_56/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_56.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"382,568\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_56.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_57/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"135\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_57-135x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_57-135x200.jpg 135w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_57.jpg 328w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" data-attachment-id=\"9027\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_57/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_57.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"328,486\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_57.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_58/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"141\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58-141x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58-141x200.jpg 141w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58-410x580.jpg 410w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 141px) 100vw, 141px\" data-attachment-id=\"9028\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_58/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"500,708\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_58.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure></div><p>In the main house at Tittenhurst Park, the group were photographed while seated at a large wooden table.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_59/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"135\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_59-200x135.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_59-200x135.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_59-580x392.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_59.jpg 619w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9029\" data-permalink=\"https://