e-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_60.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_62/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTc4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE3OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"178\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_62-200x178.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_62-200x178.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_62.jpg 475w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9032\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_62/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_62.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"475,422\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_62.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_63/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNzUiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTc1IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"175\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63-175x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63-175x200.jpg 175w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63-507x580.jpg 507w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63.jpg 600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 175px) 100vw, 175px\" data-attachment-id=\"9033\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_63/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"600,687\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_63.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>Outside once more, pictures were taken in a corner of the main house&#8217;s southern balcony.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-3' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_64/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"143\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_64-143x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo St