large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_66.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>A number of images from the Tittenhurst Park session were issued by Apple Corps for publicity purposes. Three of Ethan Russell&#8217;s shots were used on the cover of the Capitol Records compilation <em>Hey Jude</em>, which was released in the US on 26 February 1970.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-4' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_67/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"158\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_67-200x158.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_67-200x158.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_67-580x457.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_67.jpg 704w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9037\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_67/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_67.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"704,555\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-descript